    <http://example.org/node/chunk97> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our project management methodologies, past public sector references, consortium partners, available capacity, and governance practices as of 2024, what are the key steps our should take to ensure successful project delivery and coordination?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk98> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure successful project delivery and coordination for implementing an AI assistance solution for hospital staff, our will follow our hybrid delivery model combining agile iterations with a phase-gate structure. the key steps we should take to ensure successful project delivery and coordination include initiating the project through the Framing phase, where our define the project scope, objectives, and deliverables.  our will leverage our past experience in delivering similar projects to public sector clients, such as the regional council and mutual health insurer, to inform our approach. our consortium partners, including OuraneCloud for hosting and Ligeo Santé for health-IT integration, will be essential in ensuring the solution meets the required standards for healthcare and data sovereignty." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk99> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our available capacity, our have a dedicated team consisting of a project director, solution architect, engineers, data scientist, and security compliance lead, which will be allocated to the project. our will work closely with the client through our governance practices, including a joint steering committee and operational committee, to ensure the client needs are met and that the project stays on track. the project will proceed through the Design, Pilot, Generalisation, and Run phases, each ending with a formal review and go/no-go decision." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

